#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"This is a thumbnail of the current snapshot.\n"
"\n"
"The image can be dragged to another application or document to copy the full "
"screenshot there. Try it with the Konqueror file manager!"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:5
#, fuzzy
msgid "&New Snapshot"
msgstr "KSnapshot"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"This button creates a snapshot image of the screen.\n"
"\n"
"If the delay is set to \"No Delay\" the snapshot will be taken when you "
"click the mouse."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&Print Snapshot..."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "This button prints the snapshot."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:9
#, fuzzy
msgid "&Save Snapshot..."
msgstr "KSnapshot"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "This button saves the snapshot to the \"Save As\" location below."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:12
#, fuzzy
msgid "Snapshot &delay:"
msgstr "KSnapshot"

#: rc.cpp:13
#, fuzzy
msgid " seconds"
msgstr "sekundi."

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "No delay"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Snapshot delay in seconds"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid ""
"This is the number of seconds to wait after clicking the \"Take a new "
"snapshot\" button before taking the snapshot.\n"
"\n"
"This is very useful for getting windows, menus and other items on the screen "
"set up just the way you want.\n"
"\n"
"If no delay is set, the program will wait for a mouse click before taking a "
"snapshot."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "&Only grab the window containing the pointer"
msgstr "&Samo uhvati prozor na kojem se nalazi pokazivač"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"Checking this option causes only the window that the mouse is over, when the "
"snapshot is taken, to be captured. Any other elements, including menus, "
"covering the window will appear as a black box in the snapshot."
msgstr ""

